=== gofastr verify --explain GOFASTR1701

GOFASTR1701  Entity exposes MCP tools without CRUD routes
entities · entities/mcp-without-crud · default severity: error

What
  An entity sets MCP without CRUD.

Why
  MCP entity tools dispatch in-process against the app's own router. With CRUD
  off the routes do not exist, so every tool call 404s: the app boots, the
  tools list, and nothing works.

Fix
  Enable CRUD alongside MCP, or drop MCP for this entity.

Example
  ✗ app.Entity("invoices", entity.EntityConfig{Exposure: &entity.ExposureConfig{CRUD: boolPtr(false), MCP: true}})
  ✓ app.Entity("invoices", entity.EntityConfig{Exposure: &entity.ExposureConfig{MCP: true}}) // CRUD nil = on

Docs
  gofastr docs entity-declarations
  https://donaldmurillo.github.io/gofastr/docs/entity-declarations

Suppress once
  //gofastr:allow(GOFASTR1701) <reason>

Relax project-wide
  contracts:
    rules:
      GOFASTR1701: warn   # or off

