=== gofastr verify --explain GOFASTR1202

GOFASTR1202  Control without an accessible name
accessibility · accessibility/missing-accessible-name · default severity: error

What
  A button or link has no text a screen reader can announce.

Why
  An icon-only button announces as "button". A link labelled "click here" is
  meaningless in the link list screen-reader users navigate by, which lists
  links out of context.

Fix
  Set Label (buttons) or Text (links) to the action or destination: "Close
  dialog", "View pricing".

Example
  ✗ html.Button(html.ButtonConfig{Icon: "x"})
  ✓ html.Button(html.ButtonConfig{Icon: "x", Label: "Close dialog"})

Docs
  gofastr docs accessibility
  https://donaldmurillo.github.io/gofastr/docs/accessibility

Suppress once
  //gofastr:allow(GOFASTR1202) <reason>

