=== gofastr verify --explain GOFASTR1103

GOFASTR1103  Entity operation never exercised
testing · testing/entity-crud-not-exercised · default severity: warn

What
  An auto-generated CRUD operation was never called during the recorded test
  run.

Why
  Auto-CRUD is generated, so it is easy to assume it works. The parts that
  break are the app-specific ones bolted to it: hooks, validators, owner
  scoping, includes. None of those run until the endpoint does.

Fix
  Call the operation through the HTTP surface in a test: a
  `framework.TestHarness` request records it automatically.

Example
  ✗ app.Entity("invoices", entity.EntityConfig{}) // no test calls DELETE /invoices/{id}
  ✓ ta.Delete("/invoices/" + created.ID)

Docs
  gofastr docs testkit
  https://donaldmurillo.github.io/gofastr/docs/testkit

Suppress once
